Section	Detail
Objective	Verify VWO login page functionality (valid/invalid auth, UI, remember-me, CAPTCHA/MFA detection)
Scope	In-scope: https://app.vwo.com/#/login elements, session establishment, basic post-login landing verification
Assumptions	Credentials provided via config or system properties; Chrome + WebDriverManager; CAPTCHA/MFA may block tests
Test Environment	Java 11+, Maven, Selenium 4.x, TestNG 7.x, WebDriverManager, ChromeDriver
Deliverables	LoginPage.java; ValidLoginTest.java; InvalidLoginTest.java; pom.xml; testng.xml; config.properties
Test Strategy	Page Object Model with PageFactory; xpath-only @FindBy; explicit waits (WebDriverWait); no Thread.sleep
Pass Criteria	Expected UI elements present; successful login shows landing element; invalid flows show error messages
Fail Criteria	Unhandled exceptions, missing critical UI elements, CAPTCHA/MFA blocks automation
Risks	CAPTCHA/MFA; dynamic JS; rate limiting; IP restrictions
Reporting	Screenshots on failure to target/screenshots; TestNG reports via Surefire
Next Steps	1) Provide credentials; 2) Run mvn test -Dusername=<user> -Dpassword=<pass>; 3) Review results
